        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This humble oak staff is etched with a geometric pattern. <em>Quotidian staves</em> are popular among those with minor magical abilities to handle everyday tasks. While wielding the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Lore checks about food or drink.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Prestidigitation]</p></li><li><p><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ant Haul], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fishing Spot]</p></li><li><p><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mending], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Thermal Remedy]</p></li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>"
